<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Responsable> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The person responsible for a technology platform. An officially designated individual who ensures the scientific, strategic, and/or operational supervision of the technology platform."@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Implantations%20du%20CHU%20de%20Li%C3%A8ge> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "None"@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Logiciel> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An identified digital resource used by a technology platform to produce, analyze, process, visualize, or store data as part of its expertise and services."@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_UR> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Faculty-based research unit. A structured group of researchers working on shared scientific themes."@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Equipement> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An identified, located, and usable material resource mobilized by a technology platform to support its expertise and deliver its services."@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_URI> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Interfaculty Research Unit"@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Ressource> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "None"@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Plateforme%20th%C3%A9matique> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "None"@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Production%20scientifique> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The result or output of a research activity, such as an article, thesis, database, or patent."@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Autre> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Other"@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Coordonn%C3%A9es> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Information that makes it possible to contact a person, platform, or organization. It generally includes an email address, phone number, postal address, or any other means of communication."@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Campus> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Campus"@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Identit%C3%A9%20scientifique%20num%C3%A9rique> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "None"@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Conditions%20d%27acc%C3%A8s> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The set of practical and regulatory conditions that allow a user to access a platform, piece of equipment, or service. This may include, for example, target audience/accessibility (internal, external, clinicians, SMEs), mode of use (autonomous or assisted), user prerequisites, and booking."@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Equipement> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "None"@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Plateforme%20technologique> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Technology Hub"@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Image> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "None"@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Logo> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An official graphic element representing the institutional visual identity of an organization or platform."@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Domaine%20scientifique> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A broad field of expertise structuring a platform, a resource, or a person."@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Certification> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Certification"@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Facult%C3%A9> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A component of a university organized around a field of teaching and research. It helps situate a person or resource institutionally, for example. Example: Faculty of Medicine, Faculty of Science."@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Gouvernance> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Governance"@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Implantations%20du%20CHU%20de%20Li%C3%A8ge> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "CHU of Liège Sites"@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Coordonn%C3%A9es> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Contact Details"@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Plateforme%20institutionnelle> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Institutional Platform"@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Logo> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Logo"@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Responsable> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "None"@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Plateforme%20th%C3%A9matique> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Thematic Platform"@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Plateforme%20technologique> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Technology Platform"@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_UR> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "None"@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Localisation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "None"@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Personne> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A natural person involved in a platform or its resources. The person can be identified and contacted through information such as name, contact details, and role. The person is affiliated with a research unit or faculty."@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Impact> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "None"@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Production%20scientifique> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "None"@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Personne> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Person"@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Domaine%20scientifique> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Scientific Field"@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Infrastructure> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Infrastructure"@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_B%C3%A2timent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Building"@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Organisation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An institutional entity that is structured and recognized by the university. Example: faculty, research unit, CSRV."@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_CSRV> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Sectoral Council for Research and Valorization"@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Conformit%C3%A9> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Compliance"@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Personne> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "None"@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Expertise> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A field of scientific or technological competence mastered by a platform or team, based on demonstrated knowledge, methods, and know-how, and that can be mobilized in research projects or external collaborations."@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Acknowledgement> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An explicit statement of recognition indicating that funding, support, a contribution, or a collaboration contributed to the completion of a project, publication, piece of equipment, or activity. Recognition of funding, acknowledgements to include in a publication, etc."@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Retour%20d%27exp%C3%A9rience> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "None"@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Image> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A digital visual asset associated with an entity (equipment, platform, or person) for identification, illustration, or documentation purposes."@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Plateforme%20institutionnelle> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A “platform” (or group of platforms / CARE) that has been labeled “ULiège”. A platform recognized by the institution."@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Acknowledgement> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "None"@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Laboratoire%20de%20recherche> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "None"@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Retour%20d%27exp%C3%A9rience> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Information provided by a user or beneficiary describing their experience, opinion, or assessment of a resource or platform. It provides concrete insight into its use, quality, effectiveness, or relevance."@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Conditions%20d%27acc%C3%A8s> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "None"@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_URI> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "None"@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Infrastructure> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A specialized installation providing the physical and technical environment necessary for scientific or experimental activities. Examples: clean room, cell culture laboratory, experimental greenhouse, climate chamber, animal facility, biological containment facility."@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Expertise> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Expertise"@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Gouvernance> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "None"@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Service> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A formalized, structured offering provided by a platform, mobilizing one or more areas of expertise and/or pieces of equipment to meet an internal or external need. A service is paid for or subject to a different agreement. Example: analysis, training, consulting, technical support."@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_B%C3%A2timent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Example: B60, B28, B4, etc."@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_B%C3%A9n%C3%A9ficiaire> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Beneficiary"@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Laboratoire%20de%20recherche> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A team or academic structure dedicated to research activities in a specific field. A research laboratory is attached to a faculty-based or interfaculty research unit."@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Organisation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Organization"@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Service> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "None"@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Laboratoire%20de%20recherche> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Research Laboratory"@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Accr%C3%A9ditation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "None"@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Norme%20de%20s%C3%A9curit%C3%A9> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A set of rules, standards, and technical procedures aimed at ensuring the protection of people, equipment, the environment, and data during the use of an infrastructure or the conduct of scientific activities. These standards define the conditions for handling, access, operation, and maintenance of facilities. Examples: biosafety levels (BSL1, BSL2, BSL3), biological containment rules, laser safety standards, chemical handling protocols."@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Conformit%C3%A9> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Compliance with the laws, regulations, and legal requirements applicable to scientific activities, infrastructures, and equipment in an institutional, national, or international framework. It ensures that carried-out activities comply with legal obligations and the regulatory frameworks in force. Examples: regulations on animal experimentation; biosafety authorizations; regulations on chemical substances."@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_CSRV> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Sectoral Council for Research and Valorization. Example: CSRV-SS, CSRV-ST, CSRV-SH."@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Article%20de%20presse> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An article or video appearing in the media that talks about the platform."@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Equipe> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A group of people contributing in a structured way to the scientific, technical, or operational functioning of a technology platform."@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Photo> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An image used to visually represent a person, a resource (for example, equipment), a place, or any other relevant element. It serves to illustrate, identify, or document that element."@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Certification> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "None"@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Autre> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "None"@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Equipe> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Team"@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_B%C3%A2timent> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "None"@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Localisation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Information that makes it possible to locate precisely a person, a resource, or any other element in a given space. It may include, for example, an address, campus, building, floor, or room."@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_B%C3%A9n%C3%A9ficiaire> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "None"@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Plateforme%20institutionnelle> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "None"@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Equipement> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Equipment"@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Facult%C3%A9> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Faculty"@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_CARE> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "None"@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Production%20scientifique> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Scientific Output"@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Norme%20de%20s%C3%A9curit%C3%A9> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "None"@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Conditions%20d%27acc%C3%A8s> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Access Conditions"@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Logiciel> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Software"@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Identit%C3%A9%20scientifique%20num%C3%A9rique> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Digital Scientific Identity"@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Equipe> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Team"@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_CSRV> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "None"@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Campus> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "None"@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Image> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Image"@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Accr%C3%A9ditation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An accreditation attesting technical competence and the ability to carry out tests, analyses, or certifications. It is a recognition of competence."@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Accr%C3%A9ditation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Accreditation"@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Article%20de%20presse> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "None"@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Campus> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Example: Arlon Campus, Gembloux Campus, Liège City Centre Campus, Liège Sart Tilman Campus."@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Cas%20d%27usage> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Use Case"@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Impact> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Impact refers to a platform's ability to exert influence, visibility, and recognition beyond its immediate perimeter, at the institutional, national, or international level. Example: scientific output, feedback/testimonial, press article."@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Gouvernance> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The set of information related to the governance that structures, coordinates, and guides platforms within thematic or institutional clusters. Example: CARE, thematic platform, technology facility."@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Plateforme%20th%C3%A9matique> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A thematic platform groups together different technology platforms / facilities."@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_UR> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Faculty Research Unit"@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Organisation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "None"@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Autre> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Example: CSL, Department, etc."@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Responsable> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Manager"@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Retour%20d%27exp%C3%A9rience> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Feedback"@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Plateforme%20technologique> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A state-of-the-art research infrastructure (according to the FNRS definition). A research infrastructure is a specialized facility that provides resources and services to the scientific community, enabling cutting-edge research at the scientific and technological forefront across different fields."@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Coordonn%C3%A9es> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "None"@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Cas%20d%27usage> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A concrete and contextualized application of a platform's resources for a specific scientific, clinical, technological, or industrial purpose."@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Ressource> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A means made available to support teaching, research, and services. Resources include equipment, services, software, expertise, and infrastructures."@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Conformit%C3%A9> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "None"@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Logo> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "None"@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Photo> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "None"@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Garantie%20de%20qualit%C3%A9> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Quality Assurance"@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Expertise> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "None"@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Garantie%20de%20qualit%C3%A9> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The set of evidence showing that a platform or resource meets recognized standards of quality, safety, and compliance. It relies in particular on applicable accreditations, certifications, and standards."@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_B%C3%A9n%C3%A9ficiaire> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The target audience of a resource. Indicates who can benefit from a platform's resources. Example: ULiège researchers, other universities, companies, research centers."@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Localisation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Location"@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Facult%C3%A9> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "None"@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Ressource> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Resource"@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Impact> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Impact"@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_URI> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Interfaculty research unit."@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Acknowledgement> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Acknowledgement"@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Garantie%20de%20qualit%C3%A9> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "None"@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_CARE> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Research and Teaching Support Unit. A CARE contains thematic platforms, which themselves contain technology platforms or facilities."@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Infrastructure> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "None"@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Article%20de%20presse> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Press Article"@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Implantations%20du%20CHU%20de%20Li%C3%A8ge> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Examples: Sart Tilman, Lucien Brull."@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Norme%20de%20s%C3%A9curit%C3%A9> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Safety Standard"@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_CARE> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Research and Teaching Support Unit"@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Identit%C3%A9%20scientifique%20num%C3%A9rique> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A set of persistent identifiers and online profiles that make it possible to identify uniquely a researcher or platform member within academic, scientific, and professional digital ecosystems. Example: ORBI profile, ORCID identifier, LinkedIn profile, Google Scholar."@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Service> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Service"@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Photo> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Photograph"@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Logiciel> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "None"@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Cas%20d%27usage> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "None"@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Domaine%20scientifique> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "None"@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Certification> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An official certification issued by a competent authority attesting that a service, piece of equipment, process, or technology platform complies with the requirements of a standard. Example: ISO standard, GMP (good manufacturing practices), cleanroom."@en .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Personne> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "None"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Conformit%C3%A9> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Conformité"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Norme%20de%20s%C3%A9curit%C3%A9> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "None"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Cas%20d%27usage> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Cas d'usage"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Campus> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Exemple : Campus d'Arlon, Campus de Gembloux, Campus de Liège Centre-Ville, Campus de Liège Sart Tilman"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Laboratoire%20de%20recherche> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Equipe ou une structure académique consacrée à des activités de recherche dans un domaine spécifique. Un laboratoire de recherche est rattaché à une unité de recherche facultaire ou interfacultaire. "@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_CSRV> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "None"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Plateforme%20technologique> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Plateforme technologique"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Organisation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "None"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Certification> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Certification"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_B%C3%A9n%C3%A9ficiaire> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Bénéficiaire"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Garantie%20de%20qualit%C3%A9> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Garantie de qualité"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_B%C3%A9n%C3%A9ficiaire> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Public cible d'une ressource. Indique qui peut bénéficier des ressources d'une plateforme.\nExemple : chercheurs ULiège, Autres universités, entreprises, centres de recherche"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_B%C3%A2timent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Bâtiment"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Service> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "None"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Service> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Prestation formalisée, structurée et proposée par une plateforme, mobilisant une ou plusieurs expertises et/ou équipements, en réponse à un besoin interne ou externe.\nUne prestation est rémunérée ou a un accord différent.\nExemple : analyse, formation, conseil, support technique"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Domaine%20scientifique> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Champ large de compétence, structuré d'une plateforme, d'une ressource, d'une personne. "@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Autre> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "None"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Production%20scientifique> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "None"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Identit%C3%A9%20scientifique%20num%C3%A9rique> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Ensemble des identifiants persistants et profils en ligne permettant d'identifier de manière univoque un chercheur ou un membre d'une plateforme dans les écosystèmes académiques, scientifiques et professionnels numériques.\nExemple : profil ORBI, identifiant ORCID, profil LinkedIn, Google Scholar"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Accr%C3%A9ditation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Accréditation"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Implantations%20du%20CHU%20de%20Li%C3%A8ge> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Exemples: Sart Tilman, Lucien Brull"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Retour%20d%27exp%C3%A9rience> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Information fournie par un utilisateur ou un bénéficiaire décrivant son vécu, son avis ou son appréciation concernant une ressource ou une plateforme.\nIl permet d'apporter un éclairage concret sur son utilisation, sa qualité, son efficacité ou sa pertinence.\n\n"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Plateforme%20technologique> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Plateau technologique"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Facult%C3%A9> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Composante d'une université organisée autour d'un domaine d'enseignement et de recherche.\nElle permet de situer institutionnellement une personne ou une ressource, par exemple.\nExemple : Faculté de Médecine, Faculté des Sciences"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Facult%C3%A9> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Faculté"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Cas%20d%27usage> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Application concrète et contextualisée des ressources d'une plateforme dans un objectif scientifique, clinique, technologique ou industriel déterminé."@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Production%20scientifique> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Production scientifique"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Equipe> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Team"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Logo> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Elément graphique officiel représentant l'identité visuelle institutionnelle d'une organisation ou d'une plateforme."@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Localisation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "None"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Implantations%20du%20CHU%20de%20Li%C3%A8ge> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "None"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Plateforme%20th%C3%A9matique> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Une plateforme thématique regroupe différentes plateformes technologiques / plateaux. "@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Plateforme%20th%C3%A9matique> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "None"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_URI> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "URI"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_UR> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Unité de recherche facultaire. Groupe structuré de chercheurs travaillant sur des thématiques scientifiques communes. "@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Photo> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "None"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Service> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Service"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Equipement> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "None"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Accr%C3%A9ditation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "None"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Retour%20d%27exp%C3%A9rience> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Retour d'expérience"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Expertise> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "None"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Conformit%C3%A9> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Respect des lois, règlements et exigences légales applicables aux activités scientifiques, aux infrastructures et aux équipements dans un cadre institutionnel, national ou international.\nElle garantit que les activités menées respectent les obligations légales et les cadres réglementaires en vigueur.\nExemples :\nréglementation sur l'expérimentation animale\nautorisations biosécurité, réglementation sur les substances chimiques"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Identit%C3%A9%20scientifique%20num%C3%A9rique> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Identité scientifique numérique"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Acknowledgement> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Acknowledgement"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_URI> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Unité de recherche interfacultaire."@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Infrastructure> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Infrastructure"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Plateforme%20institutionnelle> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "None"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Campus> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "None"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Equipement> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Equipement"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Autre> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Autre"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Localisation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Informations permettant de situer précisément une personne, une ressource ou tout autre élément dans un espace donné.\nElle peut inclure, par exemple, une adresse, un campus, un bâtiment, un étage ou un local.\n\n"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Norme%20de%20s%C3%A9curit%C3%A9> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Norme de sécurité"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Image> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Image"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Ressource> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Moyen mis à disposition pour soutenir l'enseignement, la recherche et les services. Parmi les ressources, on retrouve des équipements, des services, des logiciels, des expertises, des infrastructures. "@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Conditions%20d%27acc%C3%A8s> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Ensemble des modalités pratiques et réglementaires permettant à un utilisateur d'accéder à une plateforme, un équipement, ou un service. Par exemple, public cible / accessibilité ( interne, externe, cliniciens, PME), mode d'utilisation (autonome ou accompagné), prérequis utilisateur, réservation. "@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Responsable> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Responsable d'une plateforme technologique. Personne officiellement désignée pour assurer la supervision scientifique, stratégique et/ou opérationnelle de la plateforme technologique."@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Photo> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Image permettant de représenter visuellement une personne, une ressource (par exemple un équipement), un lieu ou tout autre élément pertinent.\nElle sert à illustrer, identifier ou documenter cet élément.\n\n"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_CARE> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Cellule d'Appui à la Recherche et à l'Enseignement. Une CARE contient des plateformes thématiques, contenant elles-mêmes des plateformes technologiques ou plateaux."@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Accr%C3%A9ditation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Accréditation attestant la compétence technique et la capacité à réaliser des essais, analyses ou certifications. C'est une reconnaissance de la compétence."@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Personne> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Personne"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Laboratoire%20de%20recherche> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "None"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Acknowledgement> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "None"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Expertise> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Domaine de compétence scientifique ou technologique maîtrisé par une plateforme ou une équipe, reposant sur des connaissances, méthodes et savoir-faire démontrés, et mobilisable dans des projets de recherche ou des collaborations externes."@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Ressource> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "None"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Article%20de%20presse> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "None"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Logo> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Logo"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Logiciel> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Logiciel"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_UR> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "None"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Certification> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Certification officielle délivrée par une autorité compétente attestant qu'un service, un équipement, un processus, une plateforme technologique respecte les exigences d'une norme.\nExemple : norme ISO, GMP (group manufacturing practices), cleanroom."@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Impact> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Impact"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Gouvernance> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Gouvernance"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Norme%20de%20s%C3%A9curit%C3%A9> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Ensemble de règles, standards et procédures techniques visant à garantir la protection des personnes, des équipements, de l'environnement et des données lors de l'utilisation d'une infrastructure ou de la réalisation d'activités scientifiques.\nCes normes définissent les conditions de manipulation, d'accès, d'exploitation et de maintenance des installations.\nExemples : niveaux de biosécurité (BSL1, BSL2, BSL3), règles de confinement biologique, normes de sécurité laser, protocoles de manipulation chimique"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Article%20de%20presse> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Article, vidéos apparus dans la presse qui parle de la plateforme."@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Responsable> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Responsable"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Certification> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "None"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Image> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "None"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_CSRV> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Conseil sectoriel de la recherche et de la valorisation.\nExemple : CSRV-SS, CSRV-ST, CSRV-SH"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Garantie%20de%20qualit%C3%A9> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Ensemble des preuves qu'une plateforme ou une ressource répond à des standards reconnus de qualité, de sécurité et de conformité.\nElle s'appuie notamment sur des accréditations, certifications et normes applicables."@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Responsable> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "None"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Domaine%20scientifique> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "None"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Infrastructure> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "None"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Impact> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "L'impact désigne la capacité d'une plateforme à exercer une influence, une visibilité et une reconnaissance au-delà de son périmètre immédiat, à l'échelle institutionnelle, nationale ou internationale.\nExemple : production scientifique, retour d'expérience (témoignage), article de presse"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Photo> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Photo"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Conditions%20d%27acc%C3%A8s> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Conditions d'accès"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Impact> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "None"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Conformit%C3%A9> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "None"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Autre> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Exemple : CSL, Département, etc. "@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Acknowledgement> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Mention explicite de reconnaissance indiquant qu'un financement, un soutien, une contribution ou une collaboration a participé à la réalisation d'un projet, d'une publication, d'un équipement ou d'une activité.\nReconnaissance du financement, remerciements à mettre dans une publication, etc. "@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Expertise> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Expertise"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Laboratoire%20de%20recherche> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Laboratoire de recherche"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Logiciel> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Ressource numérique identifiée, utilisée par une plateforme technologique pour produire, analyser, traiter, visualiser ou stocker des données dans le cadre de ses expertises et services."@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_CARE> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "None"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Ressource> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Ressource"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Identit%C3%A9%20scientifique%20num%C3%A9rique> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "None"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_B%C3%A2timent> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "None"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_CARE> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "CARE"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Plateforme%20institutionnelle> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "“Plateforme” (ou groupe de plateformes/ CARE) qui a été estampillée “ULiège”. Plateforme reconnue par l'institution."@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Article%20de%20presse> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Article de presse"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_UR> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "UR"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Coordonn%C3%A9es> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "None"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Infrastructure> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Installation spécialisée fournissant l'environnement physique et technique nécessaire à des activités scientifiques ou expérimentales.\nExemples : salle blanche (clean room), laboratoire de culture cellulaire, serre expérimentale, chambre climatique, animalerie, installation de confinement biologique"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Logo> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "None"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_URI> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "None"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_B%C3%A9n%C3%A9ficiaire> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "None"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Production%20scientifique> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Résultat/output d'une activité de recherche comme un article, thèse, base de donnée, ou brevet."@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Plateforme%20institutionnelle> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Plateforme institutionnelle"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Equipe> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Ensemble des personnes contribuant de manière structurée au fonctionnement scientifique, technique ou opérationnel d'une plateforme technologique."@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Organisation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Entité institutionnelle, structurée et reconnue par l'université.\nExemple : faculté, unité de recherche, CSRV "@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Campus> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Campus"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Organisation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Organisation"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Retour%20d%27exp%C3%A9rience> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "None"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Coordonn%C3%A9es> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Informations permettant de contacter une personne, une plateforme, une organisation. Elles comprennent généralement l'adresse e-mail, le numéro de téléphone, l'adresse postale ou tout autre moyen de communication."@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_B%C3%A2timent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Exemple : B60, B28, B4, …"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Image> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Support visuel numérique associé à une entité (équipement, plateforme ou personne) permettant son identification, son illustration ou sa documentation."@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Implantations%20du%20CHU%20de%20Li%C3%A8ge> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Implantations du CHU de Liège"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Logiciel> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "None"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Garantie%20de%20qualit%C3%A9> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "None"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Gouvernance> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "None"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Facult%C3%A9> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "None"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Cas%20d%27usage> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "None"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Domaine%20scientifique> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Domaine scientifique"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Personne> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Individu physique impliqué dans une plateforme ou des ressources.\nElle peut être identifiée et contactée via des informations telles que son nom, ses coordonnées et sa fonction. Elle est rattachée à une unité de recherche, une faculté.\n\n"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Gouvernance> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Ensemble des informations relatives à la gouvernance qui structure, coordonne et oriente les plateformes au sein des clusters thématiques ou institutionnels.\nExemple : CARE, plateforme thématique, plateau technologique"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Plateforme%20technologique> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Infrastructure de recherche à la pointe de la technologie (suivant la définition du FNRS). Une infrastructure de recherche est une installation spécialisée qui fournit des ressources et des services à la communauté scientifique pour permettre de conduire des recherches à la pointe au niveau scientifique et technologique dans différents domaines. "@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Coordonn%C3%A9es> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Coordonnées"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Equipe> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Equipe"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Localisation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Localisation"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Conditions%20d%27acc%C3%A8s> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "None"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Plateforme%20th%C3%A9matique> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Plateforme thématique"@fr .
<urn:wikibase:item:Class_Equipement> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Ressource matérielle identifiée, localisée et mobilisable par une plateforme technologique pour soutenir ses expertises et délivrer ses services."@fr .
